# NOTE: glyph-shapes.json is intentionally NOT pinned here. It is an OPTIONAL
# build-time input (Level 4 glyph-shape recovery) generated by
# `cargo xtask gen-shape-db <fonts-dir>` from developer-supplied fonts; it is
# not tracked, not reproducible from tracked source, and its absence yields
# empty tables, never a build failure. See PROVENANCE.md in this directory.
